        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Eyes of the Dead, Six Feet Under\n- Places: Northeastern United States, Midwestern United States, Tampa, Florida\n- Topics: Touring, opening acts, death metal\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, Six Feet Under formed in Tampa, Florida.\n- Six Feet Under is an American death metal band.\n- Eyes of the Dead toured throughout the northeastern and midwestern United States.\n- Eyes of the Dead opened for many national touring acts, including Six Feet Under.\n- Eyes of the Dead also opened for acts including Anthrax, Dark Tranquility, Dying Fetus, Exodus, Opeth, Soulfly, Suffocation, Testament, and Unearth.",
